{"seq":2,"slug":"translational-medicine","title":"转化医学前沿","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine","introMarkdown":"# 转化医学前沿 简介\n\n转化医学致力于打通基础科学发现与临床应用之间的通道，其核心使命是将实验室中的分子机制洞见转化为可及的诊断工具和治疗手段。这一过程通常被描述为从\"实验台到病床\"（Bench to Bedside），但现代转化科学已将其扩展为双向循环——临床观察同样反向驱动基础研究问题的提出。\n\n本专题从三个维度构建博士阶段转化医学研究者的方法论框架。\n\n第一章**从实验台到病床**系统梳理转化研究的全链条方法论。临床前模型验证探讨动物模型、类器官和器官芯片等平台在预测人体药效和毒性中的能力与局限；首次人体试验（FIH）聚焦剂量递增策略和安全性监测的统计与伦理框架；实施科学则关注有效干预措施在真实医疗系统中推广和维持的方法论。\n\n第二章**生物标志物发现**覆盖从高通量组学数据到临床可用标志物的完整开发管线。多组学整合分析、液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA 技术，以及功能性影像生物标志物的定量方法，构成了当代标志物发现的三大技术支柱。\n\n第三章**基因与细胞治疗**聚焦再生医学和精准治疗的前沿。基因治疗载体工程、CAR-T 细胞设计与制造，以及 CRISPR 基因组编辑的治疗应用，代表了从分子设计到临床转化的完整技术链。\n\n建议学习者具备分子生物学、药理学和临床研究设计的基础知识，并关注各章节中讨论的监管科学维度。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bench-to-bedside","title":"从实验台到病床","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"preclinical-model-validation","title":"博士转化医学 — 临床前模型验证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/preclinical-model-validation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-in-human-studies","title":"博士转化医学 — 首次人体试验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/first-in-human-studies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation-science","title":"博士转化医学 — 实施科学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/bench-to-bedside/implementation-science"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"biomarker-discovery","title":"生物标志物发现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"omics-biomarker-pipelines","title":"博士转化医学 — 多组学标志物发现管线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/omics-biomarker-pipelines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"liquid-biopsy-ctdna","title":"博士转化医学 — 液体活检与循环肿瘤 DNA","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/liquid-biopsy-ctdna"},{"seq":3,"slug":"imaging-biomarkers","title":"博士转化医学 — 影像生物标志物","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/biomarker-discovery/imaging-biomarkers"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"gene-cell-therapy","title":"基因与细胞治疗","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gene-therapy-vectors","title":"博士转化医学 — 基因治疗载体工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/gene-therapy-vectors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"car-t-cell-engineering","title":"博士转化医学 — CAR-T 细胞工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/car-t-cell-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crispr-genome-editing","title":"博士转化医学 — CRISPR 基因组编辑治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/medicine/translational-medicine/gene-cell-therapy/crispr-genome-editing"}]}]}